      "writtenOn": "2017-03-21T18:51:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What \u0027default\u0027 are you talking about? Why are you talking about the default input current not a current limit?\n\nWhat happens after anti-collapse occurs? Are fall back mechanisms (1/2 or -N step back) enabled? Do they work as expected? If you tested overload cases, can you update the patch description with the details?",
